body:
@shardulm94 and me were discussing this yesterday.
In org.apache.iceberg.BaseSnapshot#cacheChanges() we are only accumulating manifest entries which were added or deleted by current snapshot. Since the manifest file  also contains the snapshot id of the snapshot which created it, it seems we can filter manifests by the current snapshot before we traverse their manifest entries.
My understanding is that a ManifestFile.snapshotId() will always match the snapshot ids in manifest-entries if these entries are adds or deletes, isn't?
